          "id": "1765539939921",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1765539939924_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are a structured data-ranking and summarization assistant.\nFollow all instructions precisely and produce outputs in the required format without deviation.\n\nHere are my existing buying groups (note \"buyerRole\" is the Buyer Role \"personas\" is the Personas): {{$context.$nodes.FETCH_BUYING_GROUPS.$output}} \n\n\n##############\nOutput Requirements:\n\nReturn an array of the three selected buying groups  sorted by fitCategory and accounts in descending order :. For each buying groups , include these fields exactly as provided.\n\n              buyerRole\n              personas\n           \n\n##############\nGeneral Requirements\n\n    Follow ranking rules exactly.\n    Maintain consistent formatting.\n    Do not include commentary, explanations, or additional sections."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM",
          "diagram": {
            "x": 5460.955232320987,
            "y": 6261.405141458271
          }
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Summarize"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "end"
          },
          "code": "SUMMARIZE",
          "id": "1765542509826",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1765542509829_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are a business communication assistant. Produce clear, concise, and professional statements based strictly on the provided top two strong-fit products for {{$context.$variables.targetProductName}}.\n\nExisting Buyer Group Data: {{$context.$nodes.REDEFINE_BUYING_GROUP.$output}}.\n\nNote that \"buyerRole\" is the Buyer Role and \"personas\" is Persona.\n\nBuyer Role  should be unique list of Buyer Role Name. Personas (a comma-separated list of unique Persona Name for each Buyer Role Name)\n\n##########\nInstructions\n\nGenerate one sentence only:\n\n\t1. Sentence 1:\n\t\tProvide a brief statement highlighting the persona represented by these comma-separated list of unique Persona Name\n\n##########\nRequirements\n\n\tOutput must contain exactly two sentences.\n\tTone must remain professional and concise.\n\tDo not include any additional commentary or formatting."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM",
          "diagram": {
            "x": 5463.580174927114,
            "y": 6681.040250820405
          }
        },
